### Get all cars
GET http://localhost:8080/cars/1

### Add a new car
POST http://localhost:8080/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Innova",
  "pricePerDay": 2500,
  "available": true
}

### Add another car
POST http://localhost:8080/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Hyundai",
  "model": "Creta",
  "pricePerDay": 3000,
  "available": false
}
### Get car by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/cars/1

### Delete car by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/cars/1

###Create a booking for car id 3
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-15",
  "endDate": "2026-08-20",
  "car": { "id": 3 }
}

###Create a booking for car id 1
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-12",
  "endDate": "2026-08-19",
  "car": { "id": 1 }
}

### Get all bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings